WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:06.423
The master has given you permission
to take the trial of manners again.

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:07.340
Let us continue.

00:00:07.924 --> 00:00:10.260
Who the hell are you?!

00:00:13.471 --> 00:00:14.848
Heaven's Door!

00:00:20.311 --> 00:00:22.230
"I am the guide at the main gate."

00:00:22.897 --> 00:00:25.150
"I am the messenger of the will
of the&nbsp;land."

00:00:25.233 --> 00:00:28.778
"Those who enter here
with no respect and breach manners

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:31.156
will lose something they cherish."

00:00:31.948 --> 00:00:33.950
"This is the punishment of the mountains."

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:35.869
"With manners, there can be no lenience."

00:00:35.952 --> 00:00:37.954
"Gain something or lose something."

00:00:38.955 --> 00:00:40.707
"This is the code of this land

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:42.792
and the power of the mountains.'

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:45.378
"Those who respect the land
will gain&nbsp;success

00:00:45.462 --> 00:00:47.881
and those who do not
will lose things one by one."

00:00:48.465 --> 00:00:50.717
This boy is not a Stand User.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:55.764
He's just a servant, a guide.
The boy&nbsp;himself has no ability.

00:00:55.847 --> 00:00:57.390
We're in a jam!

00:00:58.767 --> 00:01:01.561
Our enemies are the mountain gods!

00:01:02.145 --> 00:01:03.938
"She breached three rules."

00:01:04.022 --> 00:01:05.440
"So she lost three things."

00:01:05.523 --> 00:01:07.525
"Because she wanted to try again."

00:01:07.609 --> 00:01:09.277
"Trying again is impudence!"

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:10.445
"Furthermore…

00:01:12.781 --> 00:01:14.574
turning someone into a 'book'"

00:01:14.657 --> 00:01:16.826
and reading&nbsp;their mind
without their permission

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:18.620
is an act of disrespect."

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:19.662
"It is bad manners!"

00:01:20.371 --> 00:01:21.206
Oh, my God!

00:01:22.123 --> 00:01:23.208
You gotta be kidding!

00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:25.251
This is bad!

00:01:32.467 --> 00:01:33.551
My… heart…

00:01:33.635 --> 00:01:38.598
My heart… I can't…&nbsp;breathe…

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:41.935
Miss Izumi…

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:45.480
seems to be having a heart attack.

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:48.233
Mr. Rohan Kishibe…

00:01:48.316 --> 00:01:50.777
you have broken one rule of etiquette,

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:52.612
so you will lose one thing.

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:55.615
Is she going to die?

00:01:55.698 --> 00:01:56.533
So…

00:01:57.951 --> 00:02:02.455
would you like to try again,
or are you&nbsp;going to go home now?

00:02:04.541 --> 00:02:08.419
No way. No way I can go home now!

00:02:09.003 --> 00:02:10.797
I beg you, have mercy on her.

00:02:11.548 --> 00:02:13.967
She just wanted to be happy. That's all.

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:16.803
She thought it'd be good research
for my work.

00:02:16.886 --> 00:02:19.222
She was just being a good editor.

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:21.808
With manners, there can be no lenience.

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:26.604
Gain something or lose something.

00:02:27.605 --> 00:02:30.525
How should you eat this corn?

00:02:31.568 --> 00:02:35.989
Will you try again,&nbsp;Mr. Rohan&nbsp;Kishibe?

00:02:36.072 --> 00:02:39.993
Or will you go home for today?

